OL,3,GNEWSARSPCA will move home if new
OL,4,Areservoir is created
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn animal rescue centre in
OL,7,FCambridgeshire has confirmed it will
OL,8,Fmove home if a new multi-million pound
OL,9,Freservoir is created.
OL,11,FThe RSPCA Block Fen Animal Centre was
OL,12,Fbuilt in 2003 in Wimblington - an area
OL,13,FAnglian Water and Cambridge Water have
OL,14,Fearmarked for the Fens Reservoir.
OL,16,FThe companies are developing proposals
OL,17,Ffor the project ahead of an application
OL,18,Fto the Planning Inspectorate in 2028.
OL,19,FIf approved, the reservoir between
OL,20,FChatteris and Doddington could supply
OL,21,Fwater to 250,000 homes.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
